# Schemas & types

- Define IPC request/response shapes and domain DTOs in `src/shared/schemas` and `src/shared/types`.
- Every IPC boundary validated with **Zod** on main (and mirror types for renderer clients).
- Use strict TypeScript; avoid `any` except at deliberately isolated external SDK boundaries.

# Errors

- Shared error codes align with blueprint §16 (`CONNECTION_FAILED`, `VALIDATION_FAILED`, `CANCELLED`, etc.).
- Envelope: `code`, safe user message, `retryable`, optional `retryAfterMs`, operation/zone context — no secrets in payloads.

# Constants

- MCP default endpoint, capability enums, task states, and app-wide constants live in `src/shared/constants` — single source for main and renderer types.
